      "title": "Price target increased by 29% to ₹589",
      "body": "Up from ₹458, the current price target is an average from 2 analysts. New target price is 25% above last closing price of ₹472. Stock is up 28% over the past year. The company is forecast to post earnings per share of ₹20.35 for next year compared to ₹25.24 last year.",
